abstract: >-
  Manuscript, certificates and verification programs for the four-dimensional
  sphere-packing bound below 0.634625. The cap-intersection comparison and the
  rational check of 26-neighbour profiles are included. Some 24–27-neighbour
  cases of the sharp twenty-four-cell bound remain open.
